The property-form dual gives the same value as the function call:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->630004001,ExpressionUUID->"b0f7a3ab-aaaa-bbbb-cccc-dddd00000001"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
